Vanessa Bryant has a special message for  her daughter's on her first Mother's Day  since she tragically lost her husband  Kobe Bryant and their 13 year old  daughter Gianna back in January she's  amazing in a heartwarming Instagram post  the mama for shared this photo a collage  that her oldest Natalia created for her  she captioned the picture quote I love  being your mama at Natalia Bryant Gianna  Bianca and Capri hashtag my world you  are all the very best of mommy and daddy  Vanessa showed off some of her special  gifts on her Instagram story one being a  sweet present from her daughter's a book  titled why I love mom  she wrote over the picture quote I love  you so much at Natalia Brian Gianna  Bianca and Capri Thank You Vanessa also  thanked Natalia for gifting her with a  charcuterie board to enjoy throughout  the day Vanessa thank family and friends  for thinking of her on Mother's Day  Ciara gifted her this bracelet that has  nicknames of all of her four girls  Gabrielle Union and Dwyane Wade sent her  a beautiful bouquet of flowers as did  Rachel Zoe and good friend Lala Anthony  I talk to her every single day  and just you know continue to pray for  her and stay positive for her she I tell  her every day she's the strongest woman  I know and I'm really really proud of  just how she's handling everything and  just want to continue to be there you  know as much as I can for her as a  friend she's just an amazing and amazing  human being just just amazing  this isn't the first special occasion  the family has celebrated since Kobe and  Gianna were killed in a helicopter crash  along with seven others on the morning  of January 26 last week Vanessa turned  38 and in honor of her birthday she  revealed that she recently found a  letter from her late husband that she  never read before in the caption she  said that she found it ironic that quote  Kobe had a photo of me drawn with an  angel holding me up by an artist on the  cover goodnight  great date night you guys get to go home  now and relax yeah we know we don't  really get a chance to really kick it  without the kids man so we might might  go out hang out for a little bit the  family celebrated what would have been  Gigi's fourteenth birthday May first  Vanessa shared this photo captioning it  quote mommy loves you more than I can  ever show you you are part of my soul  forever I miss you so much every day  [Music]  you
 

